# SPA fallback for a static host that reads this file (Netlify and friends).
#
# Every path that is not a file in this directory is an in-app route: the app is
# one document and the router picks the view from the URL. `/api/*` is excluded
# on purpose — this deployment has no PHP in it, so an API path must 404 rather
# than quietly return the HTML shell to something expecting JSON.
/api/*   /api/:splat  404
/*        /dist/index.html  200
